Changed: FACPreconditionerStrategy implementations must provide the new
fillGhostCellsNoCoarse() operation, which refreshes same-level and physical
boundary ghosts while preserving coarse-fine interpolation data. Poisson
and staggered Stokes strategies implement this operation using their
existing cached schedules. FAC cycles other than V-cycles without
presmoothing currently require a level range starting at hierarchy level
zero, since the strategy residual operators can access data below a
nonzero coarsest level.
<br>
(Boyce Griffith, 2026/09/25)
